  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759106,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 10-in-1 - Arcade Collection (Nintendo 3DS)\n\nRelive the golden age of gaming with the 10-in-1 Arcade Collection for Nintendo 3DS! This vibrant compilation transports you back to the era of simple graphics and boundless imagination, offering ten unique and thrilling minigames inspired by classic arcade titles. \n\nPrepare for a nostalgic journey filled with retro art, catchy music, and iconic sound effects. Battle against the clock and hordes of enemies across one hundred challenging levels, collecting power-ups and items to boost your score. Each minigame receives a fresh, modern 3D makeover while retaining the charm and addictive gameplay of the originals. \n\nWhether you're a seasoned veteran of the arcade scene or a newcomer eager to experience gaming history, this collection delivers hours of fun. Test your skills, compete for high scores, and rediscover the joy of classic arcade action – all in one convenient package! Get ready to unleash your inner gamer and celebrate the roots of video game entertainment."
    },
